--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiMoneyNORMAL
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey Farkas, have you heard about some tall guy in full black armor?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141251
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Was the black armor made of Ebony?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141256
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I've heard vague rumors of an Ebony Warrior, going around Skyrim doing
      deeds of valor. Why do you ask?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I think I ran into him on my way to Falkreath, and he gave me this:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141257
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki pulls out the gem that the strange armored man gave her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what this is?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas gets a closer look at the gem.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141252
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. I'm pretty sure this is some type of Soul gem.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Soul gem? What's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141253
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: They're gems that some wizards can use to imbue weapons and armor with
      magical power.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not really sure how they do that, though.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe I should take this Yuri or Sayori-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141254
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Since they're at the College of Winterhold, they might be able to make
      better use of it than me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141255
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
